GROUP TYPE

 GV L2        GVAR

GROUP USES

 T  'DEFAULT' L2

 DO J         1                        N
 DO I         1                        M
 XE R(I,J)    A(I,J)
 XE R(I,J)    B(I,J)
 ND

OBJECT BOUND

 LO GBRAIN              0.0

*   Solution

*LO SOLUTION            0.0

ENDATA

***********************
* SET UP THE FUNCTION *
* AND RANGE ROUTINES  *
***********************

ELEMENTS      GBRAINLS

TEMPORARIES

 R  BETA
 R  LOGLAM
 R  LAMBET
 M  EXP
 M  LOG

INDIVIDUALS

 T  GBRAIN

 A  BETA                ALPHA + ALPHA - 1.0D0
 A  LOGLAM              LOG( LAMBDA )
 A  LAMBET              COEFF * ( LAMBDA ** BETA )
 F                      C0 * LAMBET
 G  ALPHA               2.0D0 * C0 * LAMBET * LOGLAM
 G  C0                  LAMBET
 H  ALPHA     ALPHA     4.0D0 * C0 * LAMBET * LOGLAM * LOGLAM
 H  ALPHA     C0        2.0D0 * LAMBET * LOGLAM

ENDATA

*********************
* SET UP THE GROUPS *
* ROUTINE           *
*********************

GROUPS        GBRAINLS

INDIVIDUALS

*   Least-square groups

 T  L2
 F                      GVAR * GVAR
 G                      GVAR + GVAR
 H                      2.0

ENDATA
